+- **Wallet providers.** Every read, estimate and receipt the page makes uses only the
+  profile's RPCs: rotating for display reads (balances, the gas estimate the page sets,
+  receipts) and agreeing for decisions. The wallet's own provider is never asked for a
+  read, so an outage of every profile route shows as unavailable instead of being
